Source: freedce
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Anlon-Burke <Anlon-Burke@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), autoconf, automake, libtool, flex, bison, g++
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://sourceforge.net/projects/freedce/
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: freedce
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: DCE RPC runtime and endpoint mapper (FreeDCE, 64-bit)
 FreeDCE is the OSF DCE 1.1 RPC runtime for Linux, interoperable with other
 DCE RPC and Microsoft RPC implementations (ncacn_ip_tcp, ncadg_ip_udp).
 .
 This package contains the runtime libraries (libdcerpc, libdcethreads and
 the protocol modules), the endpoint mapper rpcd with a systemd unit
 (freedce-rpcd.service, not enabled by default) and the uuid tool, all
 below /opt/dce.

Package: freedce-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: amd64
Depends: freedce (= ${binary:Version}), cpp | gcc, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: DCE RPC development files and IDL compiler (FreeDCE, 64-bit)
 FreeDCE is the OSF DCE 1.1 RPC runtime for Linux.
 .
 This package contains the IDL compiler dceidl (also as idl), the headers
 and IDL files and the development links of libdcerpc and libdcethreads,
 below /opt/dce.

Package: freedce-examples
Section: net
Architecture: amd64
Depends: freedce (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: DCE RPC example clients and servers (FreeDCE, 64-bit)
 FreeDCE is the OSF DCE 1.1 RPC runtime for Linux.
 .
 This package contains the echo and samr demonstration clients and servers,
 below /opt/dce.
